1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,840
Man, I'm starving.
I can't take this anymore.

2
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:05,340
Mmm, this is delicious!

3
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:15,350
(Even though yesterday was exhausting,)

4
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,060
(I had a really great time.)

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,600
Hey, shouldn't you be
a bit more assertive?

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,480
You need to show the drive
to sweep me off my feet.

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,520
Even more assertive?

8
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,980
Yes, you're holding back too much.

9
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:27,490
(It's kind of hard to jump in...)

10
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,610
I just can't seem to get a feel for it.

11
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:30,740
By the time you get a feel for it,

12
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,950
my shoulders will be bruised black and blue.

13
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:34,450
Oh, right.

14
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,990
I'm going to buy some water.
Do you want some?

15
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:36,790
Sure.

16
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,160
Thanks!

17
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,040
Oh! Minato!

18
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,250
What are you doing standing there?

19
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:43,540
Good work today.

20
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:45,130
Thanks for hosting yesterday.

21
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,050
The food was amazing.

22
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:47,460
You're welcome.

23
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:48,840
Who's this?

24
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,470
Oh, right, you two haven't met.

25
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:52,720
This is the guy I mentioned before,

26
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:55,510
our highly anticipated rookie, Minato.

27
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:56,430
And this is...

28
00:00:56,430 --> 00:00:57,930
This guy?

29
00:00:57,930 --> 00:00:58,930
Ahem.

30
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:02,850
This is the great Kaede-sama.

31
00:01:02,850 --> 00:01:04,150
So, you're Minato.

32
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:05,230
Nice to meet you.

33
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:07,480
Nice to meet you, too.

34
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,150
She's pretty bossy,

35
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:10,110
so watch your back.

36
00:01:10,110 --> 00:01:11,610
What did you just say?

37
00:01:11,610 --> 00:01:13,950
Nothing at all!

38
00:01:14,070 --> 00:01:17,120
Well, I'm off to get water.

39
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:21,120
Come, have a seat.

40
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,790
Thank you.

41
00:01:31,170 --> 00:01:33,680
- You have a very handsome face.
- Oh, not at all.

42
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,800
Haru...

43
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:37,350
talks about you all the time.

44
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:38,850
I've been looking forward to meeting you.

45
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:40,430
Oh, I see...

46
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:41,430
By the way, just now...

47
00:01:41,430 --> 00:01:43,440
He mentioned hosting.

48
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:44,770
Did he crash at your place

49
00:01:44,770 --> 00:01:46,310
and refuse to leave?

50
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:48,320
No, it wasn't like that...

51
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,440
He really is

52
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,900
like a locust, scavenging for food
wherever he goes, isn't he?

53
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:52,780
Honestly, every single time,

54
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,710
it's almost terrifying.

55
00:01:55,450 --> 00:01:56,700
(Haru senpai...)

56
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:58,950
(He goes to Kaede-san's place too...)

57
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:00,870
I've known him for a long time.

58
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,870
(What exactly is their relationship?)

59
00:02:03,870 --> 00:02:05,330
Oh, and that guy

60
00:02:05,330 --> 00:02:07,380
is obsessed with hashed beef rice.

61
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:08,880
Hashed beef rice?

62
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:10,590
He'll eat absolutely anything,

63
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:11,550
but when it comes to hashed beef rice,

64
00:02:11,550 --> 00:02:13,320
he's incredibly picky.

65
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:16,470
I had no idea...

66
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,810
I'm back!

67
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:20,810
Here.

68
00:02:21,270 --> 00:02:22,560
Here, this one's for you, Minato.

69
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,350
To thank you for yesterday.

70
00:02:24,350 --> 00:02:25,600
Thank you.

71
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,560
About that scene earlier,

72
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:30,480
something still feels
a bit off.

73
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:33,110
You need to convey your feelings

74
00:02:33,110 --> 00:02:35,320
much, much more intensely.
